{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDExLS0yMDE1L0FmdGVyJTIwRWFydGglMjAlMjgyMDEzJTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"After Earth","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/iXMvYIlzzJBs352CfeiQcBvovZt.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/e3posvSzYf9PjrQg27W64Kyc8qq.jpg","description":"One thousand years after cataclysmic events forced humanity's escape from Earth, Nova Prime has become mankind's new home. Legendary General Cypher Raige returns from an extended tour of duty to his estranged family, ready to be a father to his 13-year-old son, Kitai. When an asteroid storm damages Cypher and Kitai's craft, they crash-land on a now unfamiliar and dangerous Earth. As his father lies dying in the cockpit, Kitai must trek across the hostile terrain to recover their rescue beacon. His whole life, Kitai has wanted nothing more than to be a soldier like his father. Today, he gets his chance.","releaseInfo":"2013","genres":["Science Fiction","Action","Adventure","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"5.2","runtime":"100 min","cast":["Jaden Smith","Will Smith","Sophie Okonedo","Zoë Kravitz","Glenn Morshower","Kristofer Hivju","Sacha Dhawan","Chris Geere"],"director":["M. Night Shyamalan"],"released":"2013-05-30T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Danger is real, fear is a choice.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Jaden Smith","character":"Kitai Raige","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/aXCn1kRjs4sZS55xSrdmjbht7SM.jpg"},{"name":"Will Smith","character":"Cypher Raige","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/8TlKqbXYgHmmaEoPBJ7djJ8Rxxa.jpg"},{"name":"Sophie Okonedo","character":"Faia Raige","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/tG5XragN8l5Npg6viwEmvVKwt2r.jpg"},{"name":"Zoë Kravitz","character":"Senshi Raige","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/n0mhAgmY6eJQmA7kaugsTZEJgHo.jpg"},{"name":"Glenn Morshower","character":"Commander Velan","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/SjgNUSLoBAVossDI4QkNtDxYDZ.jpg"},{"name":"Kristofer Hivju","chara